Q8. Multi-Modal Metadata Ingestion & Embeddings
Topics: Embeddings

Task: Implement a function that formats document chunks into rich structured contextual prompts (e.g., combining title, breadcrumb tags, and content) before generating embeddings.

Solution Architecture:

    from typing import Dict, Any

    def format_rich_contextual_prompt(chunk: Dict[str, Any], metadata: Dict[str, Any]) -> str:
        """Constructs a rich contextual header around raw text for embedding generation."""
        title = metadata.get("title", "Untitled Document")
        header_path = chunk.get("header_path", "General")
        file_type = metadata.get("file_type", "unknown")
        content = chunk.get("text", chunk.get("content", ""))

        contextual_prompt = (
            f"Document Title: {title}\n"
            f"Source Type: {file_type}\n"
            f"Header Path: {header_path}\n"
            f"Content Summary / Text:\n{content}"
        )
        return contextual_prompt
